\caption(All compact SegNet parameters fit192 explicit Adam updates. Training CE excludes kernel L2; validation selects and restores paired learned/BN state before test evaluation.)
\alttext(All compact SegNet parameters fit192 explicit Adam updates. Training CE excludes kernel L2; validation selects and restores paired learned/BN state before test evaluation.)

The compact model has463,132 learned scalars and1,984 BN state scalars.
Epoch12, the last, selects validation mean IoU.329043, so the short fit is
still improving. Test pixel accuracy is.810140, but mean IoU is only.315424:
background.935009,circle.274629,rectangle.046585 and triangle.005472. The
model largely misses rectangles/triangles in this bounded seed17 fit. The galleries retain this failure; falling CE
and high background accuracy do not establish successful shape segmentation.

