> Conclusion

Exact winner/value/gradient checks make sparse decoding inspectable. Index-cache accounting is distinguished from peak graph memory; fit-only weights,explicit whole-model Adam and paired BN restoration support the actual held-out prediction galleries.

> References

- [Badrinarayanan,Kendall and Cipolla, SegNet: A Deep Convolutional Encoder-Decoder Architecture for Image Segmentation](https://arxiv.org/abs/1511.00561).
- [Authors’ SegNet tutorial](https://github.com/alexgkendall/SegNet-Tutorial).
